{"title":"Russian and East European Posters","link":"https://kottke.org/26/10/russian-and-east-european-posters","date":1793044740000,"content":"\n         \t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792919867-486981ee.png\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792919867-486981ee.png 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792919867-486981ee.png 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792920730-28e1de76.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792920730-28e1de76.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792920730-28e1de76.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792919892-44e93635.png\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792919892-44e93635.png 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792919892-44e93635.png 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792920742-86debaca.png\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792920742-86debaca.png 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1792920742-86debaca.png 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p>Princeton houses <a href=\"https://digital-collections.princeton.edu/collections/soviet_posters\">a large digital collection of posters from Russia and Eastern Europe</a>, almost 5000 total item spanning 101 years (1904-2004). <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/bpx/albums/72057594117941491\">This album on Flickr</a> contains nearly 1500 Russian &amp; Soviet posters from 1917-1991 — not sure how much overlap there is between the two.\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/design\">design</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/propaganda\">propaganda</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Russia\">Russia</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Soviet%20Union\">Soviet Union</a></p>\n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"cd60fb29099c8eba3bbc0f080a31e08bde8fa61aa578c0557a40619e3477d793","category":"Sites"}